00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:23.120
Speaker 1: Hello, everyone. Welcome to The David&nbsp;
Pakman Show. I'm producer Pat Forde, filling in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:28.000
