00:03:20.640 --> 00:03:27.440
Congress in decades. Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez&nbsp;
said about the bill. If we get a real baby step,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:27.440 --> 00:03:33.440
not kind of a distraction from the solution, she's&nbsp;
going to support it. So both Biden and AOC kind&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:38.160
