yeah, this is great and all, but we could just do&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:44.080
so much more if we had more willingness from the&nbsp;
Republicans to do anything about guns. Sadly, I&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:48.320
think this is going to be treated as the solution.&nbsp;
That's probably what we'll see. We'll probably see&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:48.320 --> 00:03:53.120
